Hi Oliver,

On Thu, Jan 8, 2009 at 8:23 AM, Oliver Falk <oliver@linux-kernel.at> wrote:
> Hi Matt!
>
>
> Matt Turner wrote:
>>
>> The State of Alpha Linux
>>
>> We're all subscribed to this list because we use a dying platform.
